      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly benchmarking cycle — 3PL Cost Benchmarking
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: ~10–15 partners vs. market
Owner: Logistics Manager
Participants: VP Supply Chain
Source: workflow W2208 — 3PL Cost Benchmarking</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2208_LaneSet2">
