        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-399 (ensure controlled execution — 3PL Settlement &amp; Cost Optimization (PA-56.3).) | - CTL-399 (3PL-contract accuracy — links to VS-03); operational: VP Supply Chain sign-off
Owner: Logistics Manager</bpmn:text>
