      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly cycle — Route Cost
Frequency: Quarterly
Volume: ~20–30 routes
Owner: Logistics Manager
Participants: VP Supply Chain
Source: workflow W2209 — Route Cost Optimization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2209_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2209_Lane1" name="Logistics Manager">
