      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2209_Task4" name="Identifies cost-optimization opportunities per route: consolidate multi-stop…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Identifies cost-optimization opportunities per route: consolidate multi-stop, increase backhaul utilization (VS-61 / W2322), switch owned-vs-3PL, adjust delivery frequency; models the cost impact; recommends changes
Responsible (R): Logistics Manager
Accountable (A): VP Supply Chain
Duration: 2–3 days/quarter</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2209_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2209_Flow9</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
