        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-399 (contract/fuel-clause accuracy — links to VS-61); CTL-44 (rate-adjustment integrity); operational: CFO sign-off
Owner: Logistics Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
