      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Annual contract review
Frequency: Annual
Volume: ~10–15 partners
Owner: Logistics Manager
Participants: Finance, CFO
Source: workflow W2212 — 3PL Payment Terms Management</bpmn:documentation>
